WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:00.030
<b>Summary of previous episodes</b>

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:06.200
<i>Last week on Frankenstein Family...</i>

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:11.110
<i>I'm Tanisu, a young genius scientist.</i>

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:15.190
<i>For complicated reasons, 
my parents aren't around.</i>

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:20.150
<i>I have one older brother 
and three older sisters.</i>

00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:21.880
<i>I'm the youngest.</i>

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:27.330
<i>The others have all been 
modified by our parents</i>

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:29.210
<i>to have all kinds of special abilities.</i>

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:32.550
<i>I'm the only normal human.</i>

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:39.560
<i>I've been working hard to get them all 
to adjust to ordinary life, but...</i>

00:00:40.450 --> 00:00:44.640
<i>They don't care about all I go through, 
and they keep messing everything up!</i>

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:50.070
<i>We fight sometimes, but we're family.</i>

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:53.460
<i>I've gotta work hard so we 
can make a life together.</i>

00:00:53.890 --> 00:00:55.450
<i>I'm a genius, after all!</i>

00:01:16.930 --> 00:01:23.210
<b>Frankenstein Family</b>

00:02:39.110 --> 00:02:44.070
<b>#2: Heartbeat</b>

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:44.220
Miss!

00:02:45.080 --> 00:02:46.560
What's the next problem?

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:53.390
I'm sorry. I can't take any more!

00:02:53.390 --> 00:02:54.690
It's all right.

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:57.820
That's my son. He's a genius.

00:02:57.820 --> 00:02:59.320
Superior to all the others.

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:02.680
He's not just yours. He's <i>ours</i>, remember?

00:03:03.810 --> 00:03:04.820
Of course.

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:09.750
This way!

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:15.130
Papa, how come no one else has to study?

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:19.230
Their bodies have been modified 
to give them special abilities.

00:03:19.230 --> 00:03:22.470
But to the same degree, I can't expect 
much from them in the way of brains.

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:24.160
At least not compared to you.

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:25.470
Great one!

00:03:27.090 --> 00:03:28.390
This way!

00:03:30.260 --> 00:03:32.650
Tanisu, what would you like for dinner?

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:36.900
Um... I want to try milk pudding!

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:38.610
I read about it in a book.

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:41.440
All right.

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:45.320
Then I'll create you my 
extra-special milk pudding.

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:47.970
Make some for them, too!

00:03:47.970 --> 00:03:49.890
We can't, Tanisu.

00:03:49.890 --> 00:03:52.160
They're still in the middle 
of their experiment.

00:03:52.510 --> 00:03:55.770
We don't want to tamper with the data.

00:03:55.770 --> 00:03:58.390
Now, return to your studies.

00:04:02.120 --> 00:04:06.350
Sis! How many times have I told you not 
to leave the house without permission?

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:10.360
You sure like to tell me
 what to do, don't ya?

00:04:10.820 --> 00:04:15.670
I don't take orders from some snot-nosed 
brat who can't even hunt by himself!

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:23.220
If you want to go out that bad, 
you have to take this medicine first!

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:28.890
I ain't taking that weird medicine...

00:04:30.230 --> 00:04:31.870
No way!

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:35.890
"Be a normal human."

00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:37.450
"Don't go outside."

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:38.880
I've had enough of your crap.

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:42.100
I'm telling you this for your own sake.

00:04:42.810 --> 00:04:45.880
If we're not careful, something 
terrible will happen some day.

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:50.100
I'm the only member of this family 
who understands the rules of society.

00:04:50.570 --> 00:04:53.600
I've been outside, and interacted 
with all kinds of people.

00:04:53.930 --> 00:04:56.770
I'm also a lot smarter than you...

00:04:56.770 --> 00:05:00.620
And I do all the housework all by myself.

00:05:00.620 --> 00:05:05.280
If you want to live your lives in peace, 
you should do what I tell you to.

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:08.750
Tani-chan, we really appreciate it!

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:10.080
Hey!

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:13.570
Tanisu does have a point.

00:05:15.350 --> 00:05:18.080
It's true that Tanisu is more 
intelligent than we are.

00:05:18.650 --> 00:05:22.040
We should do as he says,
 and leave everything to him.

00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:27.080
Dammit!

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:30.840
You'd better do all the house crap perfectly!

00:05:30.840 --> 00:05:32.490
'Cause I'm gonna behave.

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:37.950
Fine.

00:05:37.950 --> 00:05:39.780
I'll do just as you say.

00:05:39.780 --> 00:05:41.930
I'm gonna go shopping.

00:05:41.930 --> 00:05:43.570
You all wait here.

00:05:44.580 --> 00:05:46.820
Wait! I'll go with you.

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:50.250
No way! Make him do it all himself!

00:05:58.090 --> 00:06:01.050
You think Tanisu is okay?

00:06:02.950 --> 00:06:05.860
The blessings of the sun!

00:06:38.020 --> 00:06:38.900
Here you are.

00:06:38.900 --> 00:06:42.250
Um, I didn't buy that, though.

00:06:45.290 --> 00:06:48.220
I added it in a bonus, 
because it's so hot out.

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:52.470
Thanks!

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:06.950
Not gonna buy one?

00:07:06.950 --> 00:07:08.990
Um... Well...

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:11.490
Er...

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:17.350
You can have this!

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:22.250
It's fine! Um, I couldn't take that.

00:07:22.730 --> 00:07:25.400
It's okay. I got it for free.

00:07:29.570 --> 00:07:31.240
Say, "Ah!"

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:35.650
Ah!

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:39.510
Ah...

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:48.230
It's delicious.

00:07:51.380 --> 00:07:52.240
Of course it is!

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:55.870
Here.

00:08:01.130 --> 00:08:02.460
Bye-bye!

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:03.510
Sure.

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:37.380
Where am I?

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:39.350
This is weird.

00:08:39.350 --> 00:08:41.670
I was sure I was on the road home...

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:49.750
North Luji Road       Huaban Street

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:49.750
Fushi Villa

00:09:08.420 --> 00:09:12.520
I started daydreaming and 
forgot my own weakness.

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:15.110
I have a really lousy sense of direction.

00:09:15.770 --> 00:09:18.010
If only the others were here.

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:20.570
Do it yourself!

00:09:21.430 --> 00:09:24.370
Never mind. I need to work it out myself.

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:27.220
This is an island.

00:09:27.220 --> 00:09:30.130
If I just follow the road, I'll get
 back to town eventually.

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:56.110
One, two, three!

00:09:56.870 --> 00:09:58.370
I did it!

00:09:58.370 --> 00:10:01.240
Hooray! I win!

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:04.350
Darn it...

00:10:04.350 --> 00:10:07.110
Tanisu's been out for a really long time.

00:10:07.110 --> 00:10:08.950
I'm worried about him.

00:10:10.680 --> 00:10:12.630
He left three hours ago, huh?

00:10:12.990 --> 00:10:15.770
The supermarket's close by, isn't it?

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:19.090
Serves him right!

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:22.220
Do you think something happened to him?

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:24.820
You all stay here. I'll find him.

00:10:29.430 --> 00:10:30.100
I'll go, too.

00:10:30.620 --> 00:10:34.610
If he gets back, he'll just yell at you
 for leaving without permission.

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:37.110
We can't just sit here, though.

00:10:39.610 --> 00:10:40.830
I'm going, too.

00:10:40.830 --> 00:10:44.630
Hold it! We ain't done here yet!

00:10:59.570 --> 00:11:01.110
C'mon, let's play.

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:09.380
<i>Where am I?</i>

00:11:10.340 --> 00:11:13.440
<i>That's right. Long ago, when I'd get lost...</i>

00:11:13.910 --> 00:11:17.810
<i>No matter where I was, 
the others would find me.</i>

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:24.620
<i>So that should happen again this time.</i>

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:31.930
<i>We're not in the lab anymore.</i>

00:11:31.930 --> 00:11:33.620
<i>I need to work it out myself.</i>

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:45.470
It's been a long time since we last
 went searching for Tani-chan.

00:11:54.070 --> 00:11:55.570
He's around here, is he?

00:12:10.610 --> 00:12:12.140
I think we should turn back...

00:12:12.140 --> 00:12:13.420
You really shouldn't bite me...

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:21.460
Oh, I told you not to!

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:28.610
Take care of your teeth!

00:12:37.650 --> 00:12:40.900
The dog's thinking, "I'll get you for this."

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:43.850
I knew you'd come!

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:48.970
I-I was just out hunting... 
it's a total coincidence!

00:12:54.810 --> 00:12:56.200
I detect a presence.

00:12:56.200 --> 00:12:57.540
What?!

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:57.540
Really?

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:58.730
Where is it?

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:08.430
I just wanna find him so
 I can laugh in his face.

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:13.640
Sui-chan. Could you take us
 to Tani-chan right now?

00:13:17.060 --> 00:13:18.630
Beneath this cliff.

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:21.130
Tanisu is there.

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:31.590
To find him, we'll need someone 
with extreme physical capabilities.

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:37.270
Aisuri-neesan is the only 
one who could do it.

00:13:37.270 --> 00:13:38.760
We need you.

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:45.880
You're all so darn sad.

00:13:48.630 --> 00:13:50.370
I'll find him in no time!

00:13:55.800 --> 00:13:57.300
Nicely done.

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:02.020
Her simplicity makes it easy.

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:26.840
He should be around here somewhere...

00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:42.690
Hey, Tanisu!

00:14:44.810 --> 00:14:46.370
Aisuri-neesan...

00:14:52.500 --> 00:14:53.560
You idiot.

00:14:54.550 --> 00:14:55.950
I'm hungry!

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:58.040
You trying to starve me to death?!

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:12.570
I'm sorry...

00:15:24.420 --> 00:15:25.980
Let's go.

00:15:26.340 --> 00:15:29.790
If we don't hurry, I'll have to eat <i>you</i>.

00:15:29.790 --> 00:15:31.350
But my leg...

00:15:38.690 --> 00:15:39.730
Cold.

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:43.060
Here we go.

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:45.010
Hey!

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:47.770
Welcome back!

00:15:47.770 --> 00:15:49.090
Welcome back.

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:54.300
Tani-chan, that was a very 
silly place for hide-and-seek!

00:15:55.490 --> 00:15:58.790
He was startled by a wild dog, 
ran away, and fell off the cliff.

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:03.950
Tanisu, are you afraid of dogs?

00:16:03.950 --> 00:16:06.210
I'm not afraid of your dog form, Snow-niisan.

00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:07.490
Because you're nice.

00:16:21.770 --> 00:16:23.580
You shouldn't have gotten so high and mighty.

00:16:23.980 --> 00:16:26.580
Don't defy me again, okay?

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:28.520
You're all really amazing.

00:16:29.450 --> 00:16:30.590
You bet your butt!

00:16:31.370 --> 00:16:34.010
Thank you, Aisuri-neesan.

00:16:36.690 --> 00:16:38.050
What the heck...

00:16:43.670 --> 00:16:45.960
Hey, what are we going to do for dinner?

00:16:45.960 --> 00:16:48.560
Don't worry. I'll work it out.

00:16:48.560 --> 00:16:49.960
Cup ramen, huh?

00:16:50.450 --> 00:16:52.570
Sounds great! Let's have it!

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:57.330
I did a little improv with 
some things I bought today.

00:16:59.560 --> 00:17:02.580
Just slip your legs in like this...

00:17:07.140 --> 00:17:08.850
Now add a little makeup...

00:17:10.950 --> 00:17:14.180
Now you can go out without 
taking the medicine!

00:17:15.250 --> 00:17:16.920
Hey, not bad!

00:17:16.920 --> 00:17:19.990
Tani-chan, you really are a genius!

00:18:53.980 --> 00:18:59.990
<b>Frankenstein Extras</b>

00:18:54.890 --> 00:18:56.660
<i>Frankenstein Extras!</i>

00:18:57.830 --> 00:18:59.290
<i>Today's theme is...</i>

00:18:57.830 --> 00:18:59.990
<b>Today's theme is...</b>

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:01.530
The next ability I want?

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:03.240
<b>If you were going to be modified,
 what power would you want?</b>

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:03.240
Yes! Let's do the next one!

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:06.300
It's so simple, I think everyone wants it.

00:19:06.300 --> 00:19:08.080
But I'd like to turn invisible.

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:13.000
<b>Aisuri
Mori Nanako</b>

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:13.000
<b>Suishi
Ikuta Yoshiko</b>

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:13.000
<b>Tanisu
Sugiyama Riho</b>

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:12.440
Oh, I hear you. Turning invisible!

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:14.750
What would you do if you were invisible?

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:16.340
I'd play pranks.

00:19:16.340 --> 00:19:17.590
Play pranks?

00:19:18.150 --> 00:19:19.700
Now I really want to know what you'd do.

00:19:19.700 --> 00:19:20.920
Why?

00:19:20.920 --> 00:19:21.760
What would you do?

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:23.790
Well, I'd do bad things.

00:19:23.790 --> 00:19:24.620
Bad things, huh?

00:19:24.620 --> 00:19:25.740
Oh, that's impressive.

00:19:25.740 --> 00:19:27.560
What kind of bad things? Name one.

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:29.050
One bad thing would be,

00:19:29.050 --> 00:19:32.380
the minute you're about to eat a dessert 
you've been looking forward to,

00:19:32.380 --> 00:19:34.570
I'd make you think someone was calling you,

00:19:34.570 --> 00:19:36.000
then I'd gobble it down.

00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:36.980
That's cute.

00:19:36.980 --> 00:19:38.970
That's not as bad as I expect.

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:43.490
I think I could do an incredible stage 
performance, so I'd like to try that.

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:45.960
You'd turn invisible and then suddenly...

00:19:45.960 --> 00:19:47.040
Not a stagehand...

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:48.680
Not a stagehand. An invisi-hand.

00:19:48.680 --> 00:19:51.110
An invisi-hand? Amazing!

00:19:51.110 --> 00:19:53.170
Amazing, amazing!

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:56.140
I'd do it all manually. 
You could do so much stuff.

00:19:56.140 --> 00:19:57.590
Rotating the set and stuff.

00:19:57.590 --> 00:19:58.810
No one could see you.

00:19:58.810 --> 00:20:00.270
You could make things float and stuff!

00:20:00.270 --> 00:20:02.800
You'd suddenly have snow falling.

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:03.550
You'd do that manually?

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:06.190
Wouldn't a machine be better for that?

00:20:06.190 --> 00:20:06.800
Maybe!

00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:07.600
Second?

00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:17.480
<b>If you were going to be modified,
 what power would you want?</b>

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:10.390
Second, let's see...

00:20:10.810 --> 00:20:12.120
Teleportation?

00:20:12.120 --> 00:20:13.240
Teleportation!

00:20:13.240 --> 00:20:14.760
Teleportation!

00:20:14.760 --> 00:20:15.550
Yes, that's right.

00:20:15.550 --> 00:20:16.990
You think of that, right?

00:20:16.990 --> 00:20:19.840
I'd sleep in as long as I could, 
then teleport to my next location,

00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:21.100
and sleep in the break room there.

00:20:21.100 --> 00:20:22.470
Strong.

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:23.920
So strong.

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:25.640
Going back to the "I want to sleep" theme.

00:20:25.640 --> 00:20:27.320
I want teleportation.

00:20:27.320 --> 00:20:29.240
Teleportation is nice.

00:20:28.230 --> 00:20:29.240
Everyone wants that, right?

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:29.660
I do.

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:30.660
I do.

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:32.320
Being modified... but modifications.

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:37.250
<b>If you were going to be modified, 
what power would you want?</b>

00:20:32.320 --> 00:20:33.120
I want this power:

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:35.650
The ability to go inside a manga!

00:20:36.820 --> 00:20:39.550
It's what a boy would want.

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:41.770
You seem really spontaneous.

00:20:41.770 --> 00:20:43.340
Kind of like an otaku.

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:46.780
But I'd want to go inside a manga.

00:20:46.780 --> 00:20:48.470
Me, too.

00:20:48.470 --> 00:20:55.670
When I was in elementary school, 
ninja manga were popular.

00:20:55.670 --> 00:20:58.020
<i>Naruto</i> was popular.

00:20:58.020 --> 00:21:00.040
I really wanted to be a ninja.

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:03.210
I'd love to go into that world,

00:21:03.210 --> 00:21:06.070
but I was in 3rd or 4th grade.

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:08.910
I was starting to get
 those geeky delusions.

00:21:09.220 --> 00:21:12.900
For a while, I really thought I was a ninja.

00:21:12.900 --> 00:21:13.850
You really thought that?

00:21:12.900 --> 00:21:14.920
I thought that!

00:21:15.240 --> 00:21:17.560
During a class break, I thought,
 "I've got superpowers!"

00:21:17.560 --> 00:21:21.460
I was born in Hokkaido, and there 
were a lot of snowy mountains.

00:21:21.460 --> 00:21:25.300
Since I had superpowers, 
I thought I could climb them.

00:21:25.300 --> 00:21:27.510
I jumped down off a tall place, like bam!

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:31.100
And I had this great landing, 
but I felt this crack in my leg.

00:21:31.990 --> 00:21:33.310
It hurt.

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:37.140
I wanted everyone to made a big fuss, 
like, "Are you okay? Did it hurt?"

00:21:37.140 --> 00:21:38.780
I went to the nurse's office.

00:21:38.780 --> 00:21:41.920
When I arrived, they said, 
"What happened to you?!"

00:21:41.920 --> 00:21:43.640
I looked and saw it was really swollen.

00:21:43.640 --> 00:21:45.450
I was taken right to the hospital.

00:21:45.450 --> 00:21:48.030
I had to get a cast and 
couldn't go to school!

00:21:48.030 --> 00:21:48.800
Was it broken?

00:21:48.800 --> 00:21:51.420
The ligament was kind of...

00:21:51.420 --> 00:21:52.830
Yeah. It hurt.

00:21:52.830 --> 00:21:57.020
The next day, in Hokkaido, the roads freeze,

00:21:57.020 --> 00:21:59.040
and I had to walk on crutches.

00:21:59.040 --> 00:22:01.340
So I couldn't go to school 
all through winter break.

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:02.500
No way!

00:22:01.690 --> 00:22:03.760
I couldn't do any studying during that time.

00:22:03.760 --> 00:22:06.550
I couldn't do ratios in math and stuff.

00:22:06.550 --> 00:22:10.450
Because of that, I thought it would 
be nice to go into a manga world.

00:22:11.350 --> 00:22:13.680
Then I could be a ninja.

00:22:13.680 --> 00:22:18.270
When you get to the ending 
of a manga that you love,

00:22:18.270 --> 00:22:19.520
and you want it to keep going,

00:22:19.920 --> 00:22:22.310
you could go inside and change the future.

00:22:21.080 --> 00:22:22.980
Keep it going!

00:22:22.310 --> 00:22:24.310
You don't want it to end.

00:22:22.980 --> 00:22:28.700
If I had the power to go into a manga...

00:22:28.700 --> 00:22:32.540
But of course, even if I went 
inside, I'd probably chicken out.

00:22:32.540 --> 00:22:34.330
I couldn't talk to my favorite characters.

00:22:34.330 --> 00:22:35.880
Oh, you'd be like a spectator.

00:22:35.880 --> 00:22:37.260
Yeah, a third party.

00:22:36.490 --> 00:22:38.200
I see!

00:22:37.260 --> 00:22:39.810
A total extra. An extra.

00:22:39.810 --> 00:22:41.330
I'm that type, too.

00:22:41.330 --> 00:22:43.430
We have something in common.

00:22:43.430 --> 00:22:45.640
You wouldn't necessarily 
get involved with them.

00:22:45.640 --> 00:22:50.220
Going in doesn't mean you 
become a protagonist, I think.

00:22:50.220 --> 00:22:51.640
I'd rather stir the pot, personally.

00:22:51.640 --> 00:22:52.620
Really?!

00:22:52.620 --> 00:22:56.070
I'd start trouble among 
the central characters.

00:22:56.070 --> 00:22:58.030
Wow! You're so enterprising!

00:22:58.030 --> 00:23:00.190
I'd like to try it.

00:23:00.670 --> 00:23:03.440
If you're going inside a manga, 
take advantage!

00:23:03.440 --> 00:23:06.990
You can't say those things in real life, so...

00:23:06.990 --> 00:23:08.730
Inside a manga you can say them.

00:23:08.730 --> 00:23:10.320
I see!

00:23:10.320 --> 00:23:11.300
That's right.

00:23:10.320 --> 00:23:13.930
We talked about abilities that we want.

00:23:13.930 --> 00:23:16.090
That's right.

00:23:16.910 --> 00:23:47.250
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:18.170 --> 00:23:23.030
<i>If we want to make a life together, 
we'll need the help of adults.</i>

00:23:23.030 --> 00:23:27.090
<i>With that in mind, I go out into 
town with a certain person's help.</i>

00:23:27.090 --> 00:23:30.220
<i>Suishi-neesan tags along.</i>

00:23:31.240 --> 00:23:35.590
<i>Her power to read minds seemed 
like it would be helpful,</i>

00:23:35.590 --> 00:23:38.270
<i>but I guess it makes 
things tough for her, too.</i>

00:23:38.900 --> 00:23:42.490
<i>Next time, on </i>Frankenstein
 Family<i>: "Reality."</i>

00:23:40.730 --> 00:23:47.250
<b>#3: Reality</b>

00:23:42.490 --> 00:23:44.050
<i>Catch it, okay?</i>
